  moveClipSpeed: 3.2
  riseLines: 'Kessler: Did you think that was ME in the office? That was only the
    coat I wore.|Kessler: Forty years I fed this city the dead. It fed me back.|Kessler:
    The damned won''t follow you here. They know what I am.|Kessler: Nobody leaves
    my city. Not the Lost. Not the Damned. Not YOU.'
  phase2Lines: 'Kessler: Every body I sold, I kept a little piece. Come up, all of
    you. Say hello.'
  phase3Lines: 'Kessler: Derek BEGGED me for that money!|Kessler: I made you both.
    I can unmake you.'
  deathLines: 'Kessler: No... the river... it''s pulling me DOWN--|Kessler: They''ll
    judge you too, driver. Your name''s on that report. You SIGNED--'
  afterLines: It's over.|Now there's only the end of the bridge... and whatever's
    waiting there to judge me.
