--- !u!114 &420783847
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 420783844}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 65f27eeb84e620841b41716250897d8e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GhostNPC
  ghostName: Tomas
  nodes:
  - line: You. Your name's on the last line of my report. You didn't even read it.
    choices:
    - text: I'm sorry, Tomas. I should have read it.
      reply: 'Tomas: ...I believe you. My brother Elias won''t.'
      next: 1
      karma: 1
    - text: It wasn't my fault.
      reply: 'Tomas: It''s never anyone''s fault. That''s how I stayed down there
        for three days.'
      next: 1
      karma: -1
    - text: Who did this to you?
      reply: 'Tomas: Your brother held the knife. Kessler held your brother.|Tomas:
        I only opened a truck. I saw what was inside. That''s all I ever did.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
  - line: Elias came down with you. He won't stop until everyone who signed is in
      the silo.
    choices:
    - text: Can I stop him?
      reply: 'Tomas: You can end him... or you can end it. Those aren''t the same
        thing.|Tomas: Everything you do here is weighed. At the bridge out of the
        city, all of it gets counted.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
    - text: Then I'll get the others out first.
      reply: 'Tomas: Then go. Before the blood comes.|Tomas: Get them to the bridge.
        It''s the only way out of this city, and it judges everyone who crosses.'
      next: -1
      karma: 1
  afterLine: 'Tomas: Save who you can. The bridge counts everything.'
  onFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
