      reply: 'Nadia: A note. On your desk. It''s written in something red.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
    - text: Nadia, what happened here?
      reply: 'Nadia: At six this morning a man walked in. Grey coat, blood to the
        elbows. He turned the lights off, one by one.|Nadia: Then he came for us.
        He knew every one of our names. He had a list.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
  - line: Kessler locked himself in his office. It didn't save him.
    choices:
    - text: How do I get in there?
      reply: 'Nadia: The keypad by his door. Ask Ben about the date.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
    - text: Did anyone make it out?
      reply: 'Nadia: Maya and Sam ran for Silo 2. They still had their bodies when
        they went.|Nadia: Please. Get them out.'
      next: -1
      karma: 1
    - text: Serves Kessler right.
      reply: 'Nadia: ...he was scared. We all were. You too.'
      next: -1
      karma: -1
  afterLine: 'Nadia: Maya and Sam. Silo 2. Get them out.'
  onFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
