  noticeRange: 14
  turnLine: 'Kessler: Everything I did, I did for you. For you and your brother.
    To make us RICH.|Kessler: YOU SHOULD BE THANKING ME!'
  afterTurnLine: He said it out loud... and the city TOOK him.|That's what the Damned
    are. People whose sins came out.
  defeatedLine: ...it's over. Whatever was left of him.|Something black is seeping
    out of the body. It slides under the door... toward the river.|Behind me, in
    his wing, the safe clicks open.
