--- !u!114 &1592781274
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1592781271}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 65f27eeb84e620841b41716250897d8e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GhostNPC
  ghostName: Ben
  nodes:
  - line: We bought Tomas a cake, you know. For his last shift. Nobody came.
    choices:
    - text: Whose last shift?
      reply: 'Ben: Tomas. The night cleaner. He''d saved enough to go home to his
        brother, Elias.|Ben: He never made it to the end of that shift.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
    - text: I didn't know there was a cake.
      reply: 'Ben: No. You never looked up from your screen. None of us did.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
    - text: I don't have time for this.
      reply: 'Ben: Nobody ever had time for him either.'
      next: -1
      karma: -1
  - line: Tomas's last night is still circled on the calendar. Kessler used that
      date for everything after. Doors. Passwords. Like he was proud of it.
    choices:
    - text: What date?
      reply: 'Ben: The day Tomas died. Day first, then the month. Look at the calendar.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
    - text: We should have gone to his party.
      reply: 'Ben: ...yeah. We should have.|Ben: Kessler''s door code is that day.
        Day first, then the month.'
      next: -1
      karma: 1
  afterLine: 'Ben: The calendar. Day first, then the month.'
  onFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
