--- !u!114 &2126111257
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2126111254}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 65f27eeb84e620841b41716250897d8e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GhostNPC
  ghostName: Priya
  nodes:
  - line: You came back. Nobody comes back here on purpose.
    choices:
    - text: I left my keys. Priya... are you-
      reply: 'Priya: Dead? Since six this morning. It doesn''t hurt anymore. The
        dark does.|Priya: We''re the Lost now. The dead who still have secrets. We
        hide, and we wait.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
    - text: Where is everyone else?
      reply: 'Priya: Some of us never left the building. Some are hiding. Listen
        for them.|Priya: And whatever you do... don''t make any of us say our secrets
        out loud.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
    - text: (Back away slowly)
      reply: 'Priya: ...everyone backs away. Even now.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
    - text: I fell. Off a roof. I should be dead.
      reply: 'Priya: You are. We all are. This is where the dead wait to be judged.|Priya:
        But you came down in your own body, like Maya and Sam. That means you haven''t
        been judged yet.|Priya: Be careful. When a sin comes out here - when you
        SAY it - the city takes you. You become one of the Damned.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
  - line: Elias pulled the fuses when he came for us. He wanted us to die in the
      dark.
    choices:
    - text: Where did he hide them?
      reply: 'Priya: He hid them where we used to be. The cake we bought Tomas. Derek''s
        desk. By the bodies at the back.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
    - text: I'm sorry this happened to you.
      reply: 'Priya: ...thank you. Nobody ever said that.|Priya: Tomas''s cake. Derek''s
        desk. The bodies at the back. Go.'
      next: -1
      karma: 1
    - text: I don't care. I just want my keys.
      reply: 'Priya: That''s what you said about Tomas too.|Priya: Find the fuses
        yourself.'
      next: -1
      karma: -1
  afterLine: 'Priya: The fuses. Tomas''s cake, Derek''s desk, the bodies at the back.
    Hurry.'
  onFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
